I had the honor of joining the Edna Karr Cougars and the Lafayette Renaissance on the newly revitalized Morris FX Jeff Stadium which I helped secure federal funding for. 

On the West Bank where I grew up, there is a historic lack of recreational activities and infrastructure investment, as well as a feeling that these areas are not prioritized. Make no mistake - Algiers is not forgotten – it is a priority. 

